msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Wii Classic Controller"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "The Classic Controller is an expansion controller for the Nintendo Wii, released in 2006, that plugs into the bottom of the Wii Remote. It has a traditional layout with a D-pad, four face buttons, two analog sticks and analog L and R triggers, for Virtual Console games and Wii games that support it."
msgstr ""

